# Trivy ignore list for the Larity backend images.
#
# The entries below are all Go-runtime vulnerabilities (Go stdlib / golang.org/x/text)
# detected inside DEV-ONLY binaries that bun installs into the image but that are
# never executed at runtime:
#   - @typescript/typescript-linux-x64/lib/tsc  (TypeScript compiler, build-time only)
#   - lefthook-linux-x64/bin/lefthook           (git hook tool, dev-time only)
#
# No patched versions exist: bun 1.3.14 is the latest available, and the tsc /
# lefthook packages ship an embedded Go runtime with no fixed release. These
# binaries are never invoked by control / realtime / workers. Revisit when a
# patched toolchain is released.
#
# Remove entries here once fixed (or when the dev-only binaries are no longer
# shipped in the images).

CVE-2026-33818
CVE-2026-39821
CVE-2026-39822
CVE-2026-46600
CVE-2026-56852
CVE-2026-56853
